52
00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.220
It was so crazy.

53
00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:08.880
I mean—

54
00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.580
It's crazy because Pam is pregnant having a baby,

55
00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:14.620
