00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:39.620
the office and I was like so excited in anticipation I'm like oh I wonder what it's

102
00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:45.060
going to be and then all of a sudden Jim walked out and he was like Cecilia Marie Halpert and I

103
00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:52.660
was like oh being a sleep-deprived new mom it took me a second and I was like oh my gosh that's

104
00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:58.960
our daughter's name oh my gosh did they name the baby after after our Cecilia Marie and I like got

